        "contentEn": "Most people listen merely to reply, crafting counterarguments while the other person speaks. True listening requires suspending quick judgments.\n\n<!-- pagebreak -->\n\nWhen we listen without interruptions, others feel secure to reveal their genuine thoughts. Trust is cultivated in this silent respect."
