        "contentEn": "Spoken vocabulary conveys only a fraction of interpersonal communication. Eye orientation, posture, and micro-expressions disclose hidden sentiments.\n\n<!-- pagebreak -->\n\nAdapting vocal cadence and reassuring posture de-escalates tension and establishes sincere emotional rapport."
