        "contentEn": "Social intelligence does not equal naive people-pleasing. Gaslighting and guilt-tripping must be met with resolute personal boundaries.\n\n<!-- pagebreak -->\n\nSaying 'no' with calm clarity safeguards mental vitality. You own the right to select who accesses your psychological space."
